note A step with a link shows the linked path's name as a button (→ name); clicking it opens that path in the document. Under a path's note, 'linked from' lists every step in other paths that links here; clicking one selects that step in its own path. A link to a path that no longer exists shows as red (missing) and cannot be clicked.

